# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MON- Plant Metrics Dashboard
============================

Ignition Project Library module for the Web Dev resource.

Deployment:
1. Create this module in Project > Scripting > Project Library as:
       PlantMetricsDashboard
2. Create one Web Dev Python Resource named "app".
3. Put the supplied app_doGet.py body in doGet and app_doPost.py body in doPost.
4. Create the local ECharts File Resource at ECHARTS_ASSET_PATH.
5. Run the supplied SQL Server DDL.
6. Configure Web Dev security on BOTH doGet and doPost:
   Require Authentication, your existing User Source/roles, and Require HTTPS
   for production.

This code intentionally has no custom login page, no custom passwords, and no
custom role system. Ignition Web Dev resource security controls access. The
session user is read only to identify dashboard ownership in SQL.

This module never writes, configures, deletes, copies, or renames process tags.
All process tag operations are read-only browse/read/history queries.
"""

